<!-- INTRO -->
<div class="care-intro">
  <p class="eyebrow">Our Commitment</p>
  <h2>Crafting a Legacy of <em>Compassion</em></h2>
  <p>Melia Nae is not only dedicated to creating timeless jewellery — we are equally committed to making a positive impact on the world around us. We have established a tradition of regular donations to several reputable organisations, because we believe that business can and should be a force for good.</p>
</div>

<hr class="divider-line" />

<!-- CAUSES -->
<div class="causes">
  <div class="causes-grid">

    <div class="cause-card">
      <div class="cause-logo">
        <img src="logo-cancer-council.webp" alt="Cancer Council Australia" />
      </div>
      <p class="cause-number">01</p>
      <h3>Cancer <em>Council</em></h3>
      <p class="cause-tagline">A Beacon of Hope</p>
      <p>Melia Nae recognises the importance of supporting initiatives that work towards a cancer-free future. We consistently donate a percentage of our profits to the Cancer Council, aiding in research, prevention, and support for those affected by cancer. By aligning with the Cancer Council, Melia Nae strives to be a beacon of hope in the fight against this formidable adversary.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cause-card">
      <div class="cause-logo">
        <img src="logo-red-cross.png" alt="Australian Red Cross Lifeblood" />
      </div>
      <p class="cause-number">02</p>
      <h3>Red <em>Cross</em></h3>
      <p class="cause-tagline">Giving the Gift of Life</p>
      <p>Our commitment to giving back extends to the health and well-being of our community. Melia Nae proudly partners with the Red Cross, actively encouraging and facilitating blood donations among our staff and customers. By promoting regular blood donation, we aim to contribute to the lifesaving efforts of the Red Cross and make a meaningful difference in the lives of those in need.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cause-card">
      <div class="cause-logo">
        <img src="logo-save-the-children.webp" alt="Save the Children" />
      </div>
      <p class="cause-number">03</p>
      <h3>Save the <em>Children</em></h3>
      <p class="cause-tagline">Investing in Tomorrow</p>
      <p>Children are the future, and Melia Nae is dedicated to securing a brighter tomorrow. Regular contributions are made to Save the Children, an organisation focused on providing education, healthcare, and safety to children in need. Through these donations, Melia Nae aims to play a part in breaking the cycle of poverty and empowering the next generation.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="cause-card">
      <div class="cause-logo">
        <img src="logo-beyond-blue.svg" alt="Beyond Blue" />
      </div>
      <p class="cause-number">04</p>
      <h3>Beyond <em>Blue</em></h3>
      <p class="cause-tagline">Nurturing Mental Health</p>
      <p>Mental health is a priority for Melia Nae, and we understand the profound impact it has on individuals and communities. By supporting Beyond Blue — an organisation dedicated to promoting mental health and providing support for those affected — Melia Nae strives to contribute to a healthier, more connected community.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

